  "dek": "The public board’s top mark rose to 62.96, while Tyser climbed 56 places from the previous Eastern close. Tufa Labs holds second and the medal line keeps rising.",
  "discord": "**The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition | ARC-AGI-3**\nYi-Chia Chen leads the public board at 62.96; the prior evening’s top mark was 59.17. Tufa Labs remains second. Keith Tyser climbed from 69th to 13th, while the provisional gold cutoff rose. The story follows the leaders, the chasing group and a new public-game research paper—with the limits on those results made clear.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-10-evening-arc-3",
